{title: Koodamela Koodavechi}
{artist: Rummy D Imman}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]koodamela [C]koodavechi,        [D]kudalooru [Bm]porava [Em]le
[Em]un kooda konjam [C]naanum varen,        [D]kootikittu [Bm]pona en [Em]na
[Em]othaiyila [C]neeyum pona,        [D]athu [Bm]niyayama
[Em]unnudane [C]naanum vaaren,        [D]oru [Bm]vaarama
[Em]nee vaayenu [C]sonnaale,        [D]vaazhvene [Bm]aathaarama
[Em]nee venanu [C]sonnaale,        [D]povendi [Bm]sethaarama
[Em]koodamela [C]koodavechi,        [D]kudalooru [Bm]porava [Em]le
[Em]nee kootikittu [C]poga sonna enna,        [D]sollum [Bm]oorum [Em]enna
[Em]othumaiyaa [C]naamum poga,        [D]idhu [Bm]nerama
[Em]poova [C]thaala thechi vacha,        [D]thuru [Bm]eerama
[Em]naan porenu [C]sollama,        [D]vaarene un [Bm]thaarama
[Em]nee thaayenu [C]kekkaama,        [D]thaarene [Bm]thaaralama
[Em]saathathula kallu pola,        [Em]nenjukulla neeyirunthu
[Am]serikkaama sathi [Em]pannura,        [Em]ciyakaaya pola kannil
[Em]sikkitta pothum kuda,        [Am]uruthaama uyir [Em]kollura
[C]athigam pesama [G]alanthu naa pesi,        ethuku [B]sada pinnu [G]ra
[Em]salli vera [B]aani vera aakura,        [Am]satta poova [B]vaasama maathura
[Em]nee pogaadha [C]oorukku,        [D]poiyaana vazhi [Bm]sollatha [Em]
